RiveStateMachineProbe.riv is `teststatemachine.riv` from the rive-ios package's Example-iOS
assets, redistributed here as a test fixture under the MIT licence it ships with.

It exists so an offline test can prove the Rive engine RENDERS. Both SDKs fetch a `.riv` over the
network and there is no bundled-asset rung on that path, so without a file in the test bundle there
is nothing to draw. It carries a state machine, which lets the same test exercise the
`rive_state_machine` config key.

